{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118076","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118076/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118076/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118076/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118076","id":4187663099,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7PSjLv","number":118076,"title":"[Apple, Wayland] HDR Output: Emit window events when HDR state changes","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-04-01T15:04:25Z","updated_at":"2026-04-03T16:55:03Z","closed_at":"2026-04-03T16:54:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118076","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118076","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118076.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118076.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-03T16:54:47Z"},"body":"**This is a followup PR to #115666.** The original PR's commit has been included in this PR.\r\n\r\n### What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Parent PR #115666 adds events for Windows, but does not add events for Apple and Wayland. This PR adds these events.\r\n- Similar to the parent PR: scripts must poll `Window.get_output_max_linear_value()` ever frame, which is inefficient because it normally does not change until the user changes their screen brightness, for example.\r\n- #118079 needs these changes to show HDR info of the game window without polling constantly.\r\n\r\n### What is the rationale for the approach used in this PR?\r\n\r\nJust like #115666, this allows scripts on all platforms to change scripts that used to be:\r\n\r\n``` GDScript\r\nfunc _process(_delta: float) -> void:\r\n\tvar output_max_linear_value = get_window().get_output_max_linear_value()\r\n\t# Do something with output_max_linear_value\r\n```\r\n\r\nInto something more efficient like this:\r\n\r\n``` GDScript\r\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\r\n\tvar window: Window = get_window()\r\n\twindow.output_max_linear_value_changed.connect(_on_output_max_linear_value_changed)\r\n\t_on_output_max_linear_value_changed(window.get_output_max_linear_value())\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _exit_tree() -> void:\r\n\tget_window().output_max_linear_value_changed.disconnect(_on_output_max_linear_value_changed)\r\n\r\n\r\nfunc _on_output_max_linear_value_changed(output_max_linear_value: float) -> void:\r\n\t# Do something with output_max_linear_value\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Was generative AI (LLM AI) used to create a portion of this PR?\r\n\r\nNo.\r\n\r\n### Are there any parts of this PR that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers?\r\n\r\n- It may be more convenient to test this PR with #118079 because this followup PR makes use of the signal introduced by this PR.\r\n- For Apple, I renamed `void DisplayServerMacOSEmbedded::send_window_event(...)` to  `virtual void DisplayServerMacOSEmbedded::send_window_event_by_id(...)` and moved it to the base class to allow `DisplayServerMacOS` to use it as well. As a part of this, I changed `DisplayServerMacOS::send_window_event(...)` to be `const`, but I could instead change `virtual void send_window_event_by_id(...)` to be non-`const` if that's preferable.\r\n- Let me know if I should squash the original PR and add a co-author if that's preferable to merging the two PRs separately, one after the other.\r\n\r\nI've tested this to find it works well on iOS, macOS, and Fedora KDE plasma.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118076/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118076/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}